Matlab implementation of KNN

1. Randomly select a predefined number of cases for training, validation, and testing. 
2. Use the training cases and the builtin matlab function fitcknn to train the model.
3. Execute the trained model on validation cases and compare predictions to truth.

Currently the testing cases are not used

The folder wakeWordFeatures contains an index to the selected cases and a subfolder called MFCCcoeff contains the coefficients for selected cases.
